{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20456","headline":"同锦州胡郎中清明日对雨西亭宴 · 张籍","name":"同锦州胡郎中清明日对雨西亭宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡内开新火，高斋雨气清。\n惜花邀客赏，劝酒促歌声。\n共醉移芳席，留欢闭暮城。\n政闲方宴语，琴筑任遥情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}